## Project Structure & Architecture

`pixel-agents` is a VS Code extension that renders a virtual pixel art office where AI agents (running in terminal sessions) appear as animated characters.

- [adapters/vscode/](file:///Users/monaliza/Documents/ml-projects/pixel-agents/adapters/vscode) — Extension backend host wrapper using VS Code API.
- [core/src/](file:///Users/monaliza/Documents/ml-projects/pixel-agents/core/src) — Reusable, platform-agnostic business logic.
- [server/src/](file:///Users/monaliza/Documents/ml-projects/pixel-agents/server/src) — Independent Fastify HTTP/WebSocket server handling Claude Code hook events.
- [webview-ui/src/](file:///Users/monaliza/Documents/ml-projects/pixel-agents/webview-ui/src) — Frontend user interface built on React 19, TypeScript, Vite, and HTML5 Canvas.
- [scripts/](file:///Users/monaliza/Documents/ml-projects/pixel-agents/scripts) — Build scripts and visual assets extraction toolsets.

