## Core Commands

### Development Setup & Build

Always install dependencies across the monorepo root, webview, and server directories:

```bash
# Clean install for all folders
npm install && cd webview-ui && npm install && cd ../server && npm install && cd ..

# Compile all components (AsyncAPI, Types, Lint, Esbuild, Webview Build)
npm run build

# Fast incremental rebuild (compiles extension and types on change)
npm run watch
```

### Running Tests

Ensure all changes pass the full test suite before concluding a task:

```bash
# Run all unit/integration tests
npm test

# Run webview asset integration tests
npm run test:webview

# Run HTTP server Vitest suite
npm run test:server

# Run Playwright E2E tests in a real VS Code environment
npm run e2e
```

### Formatting & Linting

Fix all formatting and linting rules prior to committing:

```bash
# Run Prettier format check
npm run format:check

# Format files
npm run format

# Run ESLint check
npm run lint

# Automatically resolve fixable lint errors
npm run lint:fix
```

